<section xml:id="description230" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Course Description</title>
  <p>Topics in the general area of discrete mathematical structures including sets, logic, relations, functions, 
  induction, matrices, basic enumeration, graphs, and Boolean algebra.</p>
